{"seq":2,"slug":"machine-vision-inspection","title":"机器视觉检测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-production-lines/machine-vision-inspection","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"机器视觉检测\">机器视觉检测</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>机器视觉是智能产线的&quot;眼睛&quot;，通过工业相机和图像处理算法替代人工目检，实现高速、高精度、不疲劳的在线检测。2026年，深度学习质检方案已成为主流，但传统算法在特定场景仍不可替代。理解从光学成像到算法判定的完整链路，是视觉工程师的核心能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"相机选型\">相机选型</h3><p>工业相机的选型直接决定系统性能上限：</p>\n<p><strong>分辨率计算</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>像素分辨率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>视野范围(mm)</mtext><mtext>传感器像素数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{像素分辨率} = \\frac{\\text{视野范围(mm)}}{\\text{传感器像素数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">像素分辨率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传感器像素数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">视野范围</span><span class=\"mord\">(mm)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>检测精度要求：每个缺陷至少覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 像素，因此：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>需要像素数</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><mtext>视野</mtext><mrow><mtext>最小缺陷尺寸</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{需要像素数} \\geq \\frac{\\text{视野}}{最小缺陷尺寸 / 3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">需要像素数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最小缺陷尺寸</span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">视野</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>关键参数选择</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>选型依据</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分辨率</td>\n<td>缺陷尺寸/视野</td>\n<td>500万-2000万像素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧率</td>\n<td>产线速度/触发频率</td>\n<td>30-500fps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>靶面尺寸</td>\n<td>镜头匹配/景深需求</td>\n<td>1/1.8&quot;-4/3&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口</td>\n<td>带宽/距离/多相机</td>\n<td>GigE/CoaXPress/Camera Link</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快门</td>\n<td>运动模糊控制</td>\n<td>全局快门（运动场景必选）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>线阵 vs 面阵</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>面阵相机：适合静态或步进式检测</li>\n<li>线阵相机：适合连续运动物体（如卷材、印刷品），扫描拼接成像</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"光源设计\">光源设计</h3><p>&quot;好的光源设计抵得上复杂的算法&quot;——这是视觉工程的第一定律：</p>\n<p><strong>照明方式</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;正面照明&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;漫反射检测/颜色识别&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;侧面低角度&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;表面划痕/凹坑&quot;]&#10;    E[&quot;背光照明&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;轮廓/尺寸测量&quot;]&#10;    G[&quot;同轴照明&quot;] --&gt; H[&quot;平坦表面缺陷/标记读取&quot;]&#10;    I[&quot;穹顶照明&quot;] --&gt; J[&quot;高反光金属表面&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"正面照明\"] --&gt; B[\"漫反射检测/颜色识别\"]\n    C[\"侧面低角度\"] --&gt; D[\"表面划痕/凹坑\"]\n    E[\"背光照明\"] --&gt; F[\"轮廓/尺寸测量\"]\n    G[\"同轴照明\"] --&gt; H[\"平坦表面缺陷/标记读取\"]\n    I[\"穹顶照明\"] --&gt; J[\"高反光金属表面\"]</pre><p><strong>光源类型选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>LED条形光：通用性最强，可组合多角度</li>\n<li>LED环形光：适合垂直俯视检测</li>\n<li>激光结构光：三维轮廓扫描、高度测量</li>\n<li>频闪控制器：与相机触发同步，消除环境光干扰</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>光学系统参数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工作距离（WD）：镜头到被测物距离</li>\n<li>景深（DOF）：光圈越小景深越大，但通光量降低</li>\n<li>远心镜头：消除透视畸变，适合精密尺寸测量</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"图像处理算法\">图像处理算法</h3><p>经典图像处理算法是视觉检测的基础工具箱：</p>\n<p><strong>预处理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>灰度化、ROI提取</li>\n<li>高斯滤波/中值滤波：去噪</li>\n<li>直方图均衡化：改善对比度</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>特征提取</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>边缘检测：Canny、Sobel算子</li>\n<li>阈值分割：Otsu自适应阈值、区域生长</li>\n<li>形态学运算：腐蚀、膨胀、开闭运算</li>\n<li>连通域分析：标记连通区域，统计面积/周长</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>模板匹配与测量</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>归一化互相关（NCC）：定位目标位置和角度</li>\n<li>亚像素边缘定位：精度达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span> 像素</li>\n<li>卡尺工具：沿法线方向搜索边缘对</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Blob分析检测流程</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"原图 → 灰度转换 → 高斯平滑 → 阈值分割 → 形态学闭运算&#10;→ 连通域标记 → 面积/形状因子筛选 → 缺陷判定\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原图 → 灰度转换 → 高斯平滑 → 阈值分割 → 形态学闭运算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 连通域标记 → 面积/形状因子筛选 → 缺陷判定</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"缺陷识别与分类\">缺陷识别与分类</h3><p>传统算法处理规则缺陷效果好，但面对复杂纹理背景或多类型混合缺陷时局限明显，此时深度学习方案优势突出。</p>\n<p><strong>传统方法适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>尺寸超差（边缘→测量）</li>\n<li>缺料/多料（面积比对）</li>\n<li>位置偏移（模板匹配）</li>\n<li>简单划痕（方向滤波增强）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>深度学习方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>检测架构</strong>：YOLOv8/RT-DETR 实时目标检测</li>\n<li><strong>分割架构</strong>：U-Net/Segment Anything 像素级缺陷标注</li>\n<li><strong>异常检测</strong>：只需正样本训练（PatchCore/FastFlow），适合缺陷样本稀少场景</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>数据管理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>标注工具：CVAT、LabelImg</li>\n<li>数据增强：旋转、翻转、亮度扰动、CutMix</li>\n<li>类别不平衡：Focal Loss、过采样</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"深度学习质检部署\">深度学习质检部署</h3><p>从模型训练到产线部署的完整链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;数据采集标注&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;模型训练&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;模型压缩/量化&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;推理引擎部署&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;嵌入式/工控机运行&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;实时判定+报警&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"数据采集标注\"] --&gt; B[\"模型训练\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"模型压缩/量化\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"推理引擎部署\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"嵌入式/工控机运行\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"实时判定+报警\"]</pre><p>部署平台选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NVIDIA Jetson</strong>：边缘AI推理，TensorRT加速</li>\n<li><strong>Intel OpenVINO</strong>：x86工控机部署优化</li>\n<li><strong>国产方案</strong>：瑞芯微NPU/寒武纪加速卡</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键性能指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>推理时间：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;50\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>/帧（20fps产线要求）</li>\n<li>检出率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>99.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 99.9\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.9%</span></span></span></span></span>（漏检代价极高）</li>\n<li>误检率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5%</span></span></span></span></span>（过高导致产能损失）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年机器视觉领域的最新发展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Foundation Model for Defect</strong>：大规模预训练缺陷检测模型，少样本即可适配新产品</li>\n<li><strong>3D点云深度学习</strong>：直接在三维数据上检测缺陷，解决2D投影信息丢失</li>\n<li><strong>Event Camera</strong>：事件相机超高动态范围，解决高速运动场景模糊问题</li>\n<li><strong>多光谱/高光谱</strong>：超越可见光波段，检测人眼不可见的化学成分差异</li>\n<li><strong>云边协同</strong>：边缘设备实时判定，复杂case上传云端二次分析</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>设计一个PCB焊点检测方案：选择相机（分辨率、帧率）、光源（类型、角度）和镜头（焦距），并说明选型依据。</li>\n<li>使用OpenCV实现一个简单的Blob缺陷检测：读取带有黑色污点的白色产品图片，输出缺陷数量、面积和位置。</li>\n<li>对比在同一数据集上使用传统阈值分割和YOLOv8的检出率/误检率差异，分析各自的适用场景。</li>\n<li>讨论：在检出率99.9%的要求下，系统的经济回报如何计算？漏检一件不良品的成本如何量化？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>机器视觉检测从光学成像、图像处理到智能判定形成完整的技术栈。相机和光源的正确选型是&quot;硬件决定上限&quot;，经典算法处理规则明确的检测任务效率最高，而深度学习则在复杂场景中提供了突破性的检测能力。2026年的趋势是&quot;传统+AI&quot;混合方案——简单特征用经典算法快速处理，复杂模式交给深度学习模型判定，两者互补构建高可靠的在线质检体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"机器视觉检测","id":"机器视觉检测"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"相机选型","id":"相机选型"},{"level":3,"text":"光源设计","id":"光源设计"},{"level":3,"text":"图像处理算法","id":"图像处理算法"},{"level":3,"text":"缺陷识别与分类","id":"缺陷识别与分类"},{"level":3,"text":"深度学习质检部署","id":"深度学习质检部署"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PLC高级与组网","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-production-lines/plc-advanced-networking"},"next":{"title":"MES与生产管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-production-lines/mes-production-management"}}